      "lines": [
        "**14. 加速度的测量**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "测量加速度的方法之一，是所谓的闪光照相法. 它是在黑",
        "暗中以相等的时间间隔闪光，来照射运动的*物体*. 显然，只有",
        "在照射它的位置上，才能看到*物体*. 如果在*物体*运动过程中",
        "给*物体*照相（在*物体*运动时间内，照相机的快门应该是打开",
        "的），则在照相底片上，可以看到相等时间间隔内*物体*的一系",
        "列位置."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据*物体*的这些位置，怎样确定它的加速度呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "沿着*物体*运动的直线取坐标轴（图47）. 该*物体*在某时刻",
        "处于$A$点，速度等于$v_A$（*初速度*）. 于是，在第一个**时间间隔**$\\tau$",
        "内，位移$s_1$等于"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图47",
      "box": [
        432,
        1248,
        758,
        194
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-47"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图47",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$s_1=v_A\\tau+\\frac{1}{2}a\\tau^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在第二个**时间间隔**$\\tau$内，物体从$B$运动到$c$，这时**初速度**为$v_B$，",
        "它等于$v_A+a\\tau$. *物体*的位移$s_2$等于",
        "$s_2=v_B\\tau+\\frac{1}{2}a\\tau^2↵=v_A\\tau+a\\tau^2+\\frac{1}{2}a\\tau^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "*物体*所通过的距离的差$l_2-l_1$，等于位移$\\vec{s}_2$和$\\vec{s}_1$的绝对",
        "值的差，所以，$l_2-l_1=|\\vec{s}_2|-|\\vec{s}_1|$"
      ]
    },
